litellm-puter (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * Complete Poetry-based Python package
  * Systemd service for background execution
  * Configuration in /etc/litellm-puter following FHS
  * Support for 488+ AI models via Puter API
  * Models from OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, xAI, Gemini, Mistral
  * Optional SOCKS5/HTTP/HTTPS proxy support
  * Comprehensive documentation reorganized
  * CLI tools: litellm-puter, litellm-puter-gateway
  * Security hardened systemd service
  * Dedicated system user (litellm-puter)

